8DVsu46fkssr6fxvawmQ98THx82Sai_hKeSCCdHhkX9b0nrAhofWHo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af80tY1-05rppWo-9g_6RlUdl2iR_9C5YtujEaS7F229Zw&oe=6A47C397"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2560 x 1440.png", "id": "2002895760600819", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499305050_2002895763934152_8091649064980833119_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=V6Vf-W2yWZUQ7kNvwGYOhF-&_nc_oc=Adr0wgNTH86IR9jz-UH3i4Aa3AD_qU5bQrwTO-NaVfB4l1QTd0-7hpEPj-JLnUFLWWE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9ZeaZS6wrytqnDuWRRFFnN3SryB76T-5ZlWBjwwlKvhQ&oe=6A47D67F"}, "display_name": "Ward 13 - Haunted Hospital", "keywords": ["horror", "hospital", "scary", "haunted"], "long_description": "Enter **Ward 13: Haunted Hospital,** where reality bends, and every floor hides a new terror. \ud83d\udc7b\n\n**Every Step Feels Wrong** \ud83d\udc80\n\nEvery step feels heavier as you ascend the stairs, entering the dimly lit hospital corridor. A solitary figure sits in the distance, its presence amplified by the flickering lights will you move forward or turn back? The tension builds.\n{1587903332508506}\n\n**A Haunting Presence** \ud83d\ude31\n\nAs you move cautiously through the dark hospital corridor, a Horror Anomaly suddenly manifests a distorted humanoid figure standing in the center. With its blurred features and eerie presence near an abandoned wheelchair, the figure is bathed in a flashing red light, signaling imminent danger. Your every move is critical as the tension escalates in this nerve wracking encounter. Will you survive the twisted horrors of Ward 13?\n\n{1596323104766146}\n\n**The Horror Anomaly Crawls** \u2620\ufe0e\ufe0e\n\nUnder the eerie red emergency light, a Horror Anomaly in the form of a dark humanoid entity rapidly crawls toward the player. The unsettling presence, combined with an abandoned wheelchair in the hospital hallway, hints at a chaotic event that just unfolded, heightening the tension.\n{1449804570501096}\n\n**The Entity of Floor 13** \ud83d\udc7b\n\nEnter the nightmarish depths of Floor 13, where reality itself begins to crumble. A shadowy figure with glowing red horns watches ominously over motionless patients, and surreal distortions like a massive orange fist floating in the center signal the collapse of the hospital\u2019s reality.\n{939791968917715}", "short_description": "Ward 13: Haunted Hospital is a psychological horror game set in a twisted, maze-like hospital. As you journey through 13 floors, you must face disturbing anomalies, eerie entities, and supernatural horrors lurking around every corner. The hospital's distorted reality blurs the line between the physical and the psychological, building intense tension as you uncover dark secrets and encounter the terrifying Warden of Floor 13. Can you survive the horrors and reach the top floor?"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://tretastudios.com/vrprivacypolicy.php", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "TretaStudios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://tretastudios.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "644354873106712"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "en_US", "en_AU", "en_CA", "en_ZA", "en_GB"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "34640169148964743"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBL